WEBVTT

00:04.770 --> 00:05.860
<b>Let's find some shade.</b>

00:21.200 --> 00:22.500
You're a cute couple.

00:26.850 --> 00:27.740
<b>What was—</b>

00:28.040 --> 00:29.550
<b>Are you okay, Touko?</b>

00:30.100 --> 00:32.680
<b>You scared me. What happened?</b>

00:32.680 --> 00:34.630
<b>What? Sorry,</b>

00:34.630 --> 00:36.340
<b>I don't really know.</b>

00:38.570 --> 00:40.560
<b>Seems like you're okay for now.</b>

00:41.320 --> 00:42.180
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:45.620 --> 00:46.940
<b>I'll take you home.</b>

00:47.650 --> 00:48.490
<b>Please.</b>

00:48.490 --> 00:49.650
<b>I'd like you to.</b>

00:50.560 --> 00:52.570
<b>I'm going to ask for a proper explanation.</b>

00:55.110 --> 00:57.700
You're going to help Touko-chan, right?

01:15.520 --> 01:16.580
<b>He's not coming.</b>

01:16.580 --> 01:17.920
<b>No fun.</b>

01:17.920 --> 01:20.580
<b>Why aren't you coming, 5:30 guy?</b>

02:57.110 --> 03:01.570
<b>Episode 8
"Snow"</b>

03:00.070 --> 03:02.070
Hinode-hama High School 
Track Club Summer Camp

03:17.860 --> 03:18.920
<b>Hey, Yukinari.</b>

03:19.500 --> 03:21.190
<b>The hero returns, huh?</b>

03:21.490 --> 03:22.840
<b>Thanks.</b>

03:22.840 --> 03:24.800
<b>We were waiting for you. How're you doing?</b>

03:24.800 --> 03:27.140
<b>Still taking it slow.</b>

03:27.140 --> 03:28.530
<b>Let's get going.</b>

03:28.530 --> 03:29.350
<b>Bring it in!</b>

03:31.810 --> 03:34.310
<b>Hinode Dance School</b>

03:43.360 --> 03:45.700
No! No!

03:46.090 --> 03:48.740
Did you hear me? We're not 
doing the beach trip today.

04:26.610 --> 04:27.830
<b>Looks like he's here.</b>

04:27.830 --> 04:28.910
<b>Coming.</b>

04:33.790 --> 04:35.240
<b>Yanagi-chan!</b>

04:35.240 --> 04:37.120
<b>Long time no see, Auntie.</b>

04:37.120 --> 04:41.120
<b>It's a day late, but she's being 
discharged this afternoon.</b>

04:41.500 --> 04:43.430
<b>I came in time, then.</b>

04:46.840 --> 04:48.580
<b>Thank you, Yanagi-chan.</b>

04:48.580 --> 04:49.400
<b>You're welcome.</b>

04:49.400 --> 04:51.250
<b>We're just going to the rooftop.</b>

04:51.250 --> 04:53.230
<b>We'll be back in about twenty minutes.</b>

04:58.470 --> 05:00.120
<b>Oh!</b>

05:01.400 --> 05:04.330
<b>I heard from Hiro. You're in for tests?</b>

05:04.330 --> 05:04.950
<b>Yes.</b>

05:05.500 --> 05:08.000
<b>I brought steamed sake buns for you today.</b>

05:08.510 --> 05:10.030
<b>Be good to Hiro for me.</b>

05:13.490 --> 05:14.330
<b>Sure.</b>

05:21.400 --> 05:24.070
<b>You've been with Hiro 
a lot lately, haven't you?</b>

05:24.460 --> 05:25.170
<b>Yeah.</b>

05:25.550 --> 05:27.800
<b>Hiro made it so obvious.</b>

05:30.310 --> 05:32.300
<b>Did something happen with Hiro?</b>

05:32.960 --> 05:33.850
<b>Yeah.</b>

05:34.830 --> 05:35.920
<b>I won't ask, then.</b>

05:37.890 --> 05:40.240
<b>The beach trip got canceled last-minute,</b>

05:40.240 --> 05:42.510
<b>but it's kinda for the best since
your hospital stay was extended.</b>

05:42.860 --> 05:44.450
<b>But I was looking forward to it,</b>

05:44.450 --> 05:47.760
<b>and I had my bathing suit ready 
and everything, so I went.</b>

05:49.270 --> 05:52.270
<b>Oh. With Yukinari-kun, then?</b>

05:52.270 --> 05:53.760
<b>About that,</b>

05:53.760 --> 05:57.440
<b>Yuki went off to a summer camp for track club.</b>

05:57.440 --> 05:58.550
<b>Way late.</b>

05:58.550 --> 05:59.790
<b>Oh, yeah?</b>

06:00.090 --> 06:03.570
<b>Yeah, and he didn't even tell me.</b>

06:04.380 --> 06:05.990
<b>I think I won't ask.</b>

06:08.370 --> 06:10.420
<b>I came to the hospital because</b>

06:10.420 --> 06:12.450
<b>there was something I wanted to ask you.</b>

06:13.410 --> 06:14.890
<b>Since I was visiting anyway.</b>

06:15.840 --> 06:16.390
<b>Yeah.</b>

06:18.170 --> 06:21.460
<b>Touko and David are kind of strange.</b>

06:22.220 --> 06:25.840
<b>Touko and David seem to have 
feelings for each other.</b>

06:25.840 --> 06:26.700
<b>Did you know?</b>

06:28.420 --> 06:29.440
<b>I did.</b>

06:30.950 --> 06:33.500
<b>Seems like they have a secret.</b>

06:33.850 --> 06:35.850
<b>I thought you might know.</b>

06:37.090 --> 06:38.220
<b>Would you tell me?</b>

06:38.980 --> 06:41.210
<b>Or did you promise Touko not to?</b>

06:42.030 --> 06:43.640
<b>I didn't promise Touko anything,</b>

06:44.170 --> 06:47.120
<b>but I don't really know much.</b>

06:52.250 --> 06:55.310
<b>Mr. Boyfriend isn't coming today.</b>

06:55.750 --> 06:56.520
<b>Yeah.</b>

06:59.380 --> 07:00.620
<b>I want cookies.</b>

07:01.230 --> 07:02.840
<b>I'll make some tea.</b>

07:03.250 --> 07:05.910
<b>I think I'll join you, too.</b>

07:05.910 --> 07:06.780
<b>Sure.</b>

07:17.070 --> 07:19.240
<b>Touko, are you awake?</b>

07:19.820 --> 07:21.420
<b>I'm awake.</b>

07:28.650 --> 07:30.480
<b>Mom said to bring this.</b>

07:32.300 --> 07:33.450
<b>Thanks.</b>

07:34.430 --> 07:36.010
<b>Can I stay for a bit?</b>

07:36.310 --> 07:37.080
<b>Sure.</b>

07:59.070 --> 08:00.500
<b>Fine, fine.</b>

08:07.430 --> 08:08.170
<b>How was it?</b>

08:14.040 --> 08:14.960
<i>Are you okay?</i>

08:15.260 --> 08:16.020
<b>Yeah.</b>

08:16.780 --> 08:18.950
<b>What was that?</b>

08:19.270 --> 08:22.100
<i>Sorry, I don't really know either.</i>

08:23.880 --> 08:24.920
<i>Let's meet up.</i>

08:26.330 --> 08:28.220
<i>Are you afraid you might see 
something like that again?</i>

08:29.830 --> 08:30.990
<b>Where should we meet?</b>

08:31.400 --> 08:32.420
<i>Let's see...</i>

08:32.420 --> 08:35.320
<b>I think I want to see Jonathan.</b>

08:35.320 --> 08:37.630
<i>All right, good idea.</i>

08:37.630 --> 08:39.070
<i>See you in an hour.</i>

08:39.070 --> 08:39.850
<b>Yeah.</b>

08:44.420 --> 08:47.910
<b>Touko said you'd be fine when</b>

08:47.910 --> 08:50.140
<b>you were being hospitalized.</b>

08:50.140 --> 08:52.620
<b>Like she knew about the future.</b>

08:53.040 --> 08:53.970
<b>Yeah?</b>

08:53.970 --> 08:57.760
<b>Oh yeah, and when David 
first came to Kazemichi,</b>

08:57.760 --> 09:00.060
<b>he said something about "seeing 
the same thing as you."</b>

09:00.990 --> 09:03.980
<b>"I saw what you saw," was it?</b>

09:04.720 --> 09:06.230
<b>You know something, don't you?</b>

09:07.350 --> 09:10.600
<b>Like I said, I don't know too much.</b>

09:11.140 --> 09:13.470
<b>I should tell you</b>

09:13.470 --> 09:15.340
<b>everything I know, shouldn't I?</b>

09:17.730 --> 09:21.540
<b>I think Touko-chan and David 
have a special relationship.</b>

09:24.050 --> 09:25.070
<b>Sachi,</b>

09:25.680 --> 09:27.230
<b>about Touko, do you—</b>

09:32.050 --> 09:33.090
<b>Not bad.</b>

09:33.090 --> 09:33.950
<b>Thanks.</b>

09:34.680 --> 09:35.540
<b>The other day...</b>

09:36.050 --> 09:36.750
<b>Huh?</b>

09:37.150 --> 09:39.460
<b>Sorry, I said something 
stupid at the track meet.</b>

09:40.400 --> 09:42.470
<b>We're even, aren't we?</b>

09:46.160 --> 09:47.100
<b>Imi!</b>

09:47.440 --> 09:48.460
<b>Yes?</b>

10:02.070 --> 10:04.580
<b>I saw Yana-chan at the hospital.</b>

10:05.160 --> 10:05.950
<b>Yeah?</b>

10:05.950 --> 10:08.510
<b>Huh, aren't you going today?</b>

10:08.780 --> 10:09.440
<b>Nope.</b>

10:10.200 --> 10:15.270
<b>But I told the girl with the 
glasses to be good to you.</b>

10:15.270 --> 10:17.660
<b>You have to do your part.</b>

10:17.660 --> 10:18.470
<b>Sure.</b>

10:22.170 --> 10:24.570
<b>So something did happen.</b>

10:32.290 --> 10:34.890
<b>Kakeru, are you having fun, living here?</b>

10:35.200 --> 10:38.220
<b>Sure, I think.</b>

10:38.880 --> 10:39.540
<b>Okay.</b>

10:50.870 --> 10:52.420
<b>I'm going to school.</b>

10:52.420 --> 10:54.090
<b>Hey, Onee-chan.</b>

10:54.570 --> 10:55.590
<b>Yeah?</b>

10:56.600 --> 10:58.080
<b>Sorry about earlier.</b>

10:58.310 --> 10:59.250
<b>No,</b>

11:00.520 --> 11:03.350
<b>about Yukinari-san.</b>

11:04.950 --> 11:07.310
<b>I mean, I wasn't</b>

11:07.310 --> 11:09.150
<b>like this before.</b>

11:21.450 --> 11:25.250
<b>So I did something unlike 
me, and I got worked up</b>

11:25.250 --> 11:28.890
<b>and chased him on my bike, 
and I told him to stay attractive.</b>

11:29.190 --> 11:31.110
<b>You talked to him?</b>

11:31.990 --> 11:32.940
<b>Yeah, I guess.</b>

11:35.010 --> 11:35.940
<b>But...</b>

11:35.940 --> 11:37.840
<b>But what?</b>

11:38.090 --> 11:40.370
<b>He wasn't running yesterday.</b>

11:40.750 --> 11:44.260
<b>Everyone was making a fuss, because they 
look forward to seeing him every day.</b>

11:44.560 --> 11:45.880
<b>Really?</b>

11:45.880 --> 11:49.310
<b>I have practice soon, too, so I'll go check.</b>

11:50.190 --> 11:51.240
<b>Oh,</b>

11:51.790 --> 11:53.220
<b>he's not running.</b>

14:09.300 --> 14:10.870
<b>Let's watch them next time.</b>

14:10.870 --> 14:11.830
<b>When they're making stuff?</b>

14:11.830 --> 14:12.660
<b>Yeah.</b>

14:20.660 --> 14:21.850
<b>What's wrong?</b>

14:24.260 --> 14:25.090
<b>Oh,</b>

14:25.800 --> 14:26.550
<b>nothing.</b>

15:01.160 --> 15:02.010
<b>There!</b>

15:03.020 --> 15:03.980
<b>Who's that?</b>

15:28.550 --> 15:32.240
<b>Are we not going to be able to 
sit next to each other anymore?</b>

15:32.640 --> 15:33.940
<b>We can.</b>

15:43.910 --> 15:46.120
<b>What do you think it was?</b>

15:47.140 --> 15:50.640
<b>I'm a little afraid to be next to you now.</b>

15:51.300 --> 15:52.430
<b>I'm terrible, huh?</b>

15:53.460 --> 15:55.640
<b>I don't know what it was either.</b>

15:56.370 --> 15:59.300
<b>But yeah, I'm a little wary of coming</b>

15:59.300 --> 16:01.040
<b>close to you right now.</b>

16:06.360 --> 16:09.360
From: Hina
No subject
Yanagi-san's running 
instead of Yukinari-san

16:12.070 --> 16:14.530
<b>Oh, it's from my sister.</b>

16:14.980 --> 16:17.280
<b>Yuki-kun's turned into Yana-chan.</b>

16:24.150 --> 16:25.680
<b>Hina-chan, the other day...</b>

16:26.050 --> 16:28.170
<b>Oh, my sister's name is Hina.</b>

16:28.800 --> 16:31.850
<b>Hina-chan's swim club...</b>

16:32.150 --> 16:35.140
<b>Oh, do you mind if I talk about Yuki-kun?</b>

16:35.600 --> 16:37.300
<b>What about her swim club?</b>

16:37.850 --> 16:40.370
<b>Yeah, he's popular at the swim club.</b>

16:44.730 --> 16:48.410
<b>I called Yana-chan, but 
she wouldn't pick up.</b>

16:48.410 --> 16:51.980
<b>From what I heard, it doesn't 
sound like Takayama is panicking,</b>

16:51.980 --> 16:53.570
<b>so I think it'll be okay.</b>

16:53.870 --> 16:56.890
<b>I wonder. I hope so.</b>

16:58.170 --> 16:59.390
<b>Are you</b>

16:59.690 --> 17:02.260
<b>worried about me, Kakeru-kun?</b>

17:02.800 --> 17:03.560
<b>Yeah.</b>

17:04.070 --> 17:07.650
<b>I don't think there's a reason 
to worry about Yukinari Imi,</b>

17:08.180 --> 17:12.030
<b>but if it's bothering you, 
we could go to his place together.</b>

17:12.590 --> 17:13.520
<b>Sure.</b>

17:19.990 --> 17:21.320
<b>I was sketching here</b>

17:21.900 --> 17:24.350
<b>a while ago, just like this,</b>

17:24.650 --> 17:26.000
<b>and I saw Yuki-kun.</b>

17:26.630 --> 17:30.250
<b>So we went to the art class prep room 
to pick up Conté crayons, and...</b>

17:33.840 --> 17:36.990
<b>And there, he...</b>

17:37.880 --> 17:38.670
Touko,

17:38.970 --> 17:42.290
are you thinking about that Kakeru guy?

17:43.060 --> 17:44.180
What now?

17:45.220 --> 17:46.750
Do you like him?

17:48.330 --> 17:49.190
I see.

17:49.620 --> 17:50.380
You do.

17:50.900 --> 17:52.340
No, it's not that.

17:52.970 --> 17:56.350
<b>So I was surprised, too.</b>

17:57.600 --> 17:59.410
<b>I'm talking about Yuki-kun again.</b>

18:00.560 --> 18:03.170
<b>I see. So that happened.</b>

18:03.170 --> 18:05.720
<b>Oh, no, that's really all it was.</b>

18:05.720 --> 18:07.190
<b>Nothing more.</b>

18:09.180 --> 18:12.610
<b>But then you hesitated quite a bit, didn't you?</b>

18:14.000 --> 18:16.030
<b>We might learn something new about</b>

18:16.330 --> 18:19.880
<b>the fragments of the future if we 
go to the art-class prep room.</b>

18:20.220 --> 18:21.270
<b>Really?</b>

18:21.810 --> 18:23.750
<b>How about you go there with me this time?</b>

18:26.020 --> 18:27.000
<b>But—</b>

18:27.000 --> 18:27.750
<b>What?</b>

18:28.590 --> 18:30.450
<b>Right, maybe...</b>

18:30.450 --> 18:31.330
<b>What—</b>

18:31.330 --> 18:32.080
<b>Where is it?</b>

18:33.330 --> 18:34.860
<b>Through the front door, and to the right.</b>

18:41.020 --> 18:42.010
<b>This way.</b>

18:54.400 --> 18:55.600
<b>Here it is.</b>

19:12.630 --> 19:14.630
<b>All contacts     Details     Edit</b>

19:12.630 --> 19:14.630
Hiro Shirosaki

19:12.630 --> 19:14.630
<b>Cell 
080 552 1068</b>

19:22.140 --> 19:24.350
<i>The customer you have dialed</i>

19:24.350 --> 19:26.540
<i>is out of the service area, or—</i>

19:27.650 --> 19:31.260
<b>We should probably tell 
Yukinari Imi or Takayama.</b>

19:31.560 --> 19:33.150
<b>Huh, why?</b>

19:33.780 --> 19:35.850
<b>Why should we tell everyone?</b>

19:36.510 --> 19:38.660
<b>What do you think Takayama thought</b>

19:38.660 --> 19:40.870
<b>when she saw us at the beach?</b>

19:40.870 --> 19:42.330
<b>Well,</b>

19:42.630 --> 19:44.420
<b>I'm sure she was surprised.</b>

19:44.420 --> 19:45.610
<b>But is that it?</b>

19:47.350 --> 19:51.120
<b>Takayama will surely ask 
you about what happened.</b>

19:51.570 --> 19:53.660
<b>But how am I supposed to explain?</b>

19:54.120 --> 19:55.840
<b>She would never believe me.</b>

19:57.150 --> 20:00.340
<b>If that kind of thing is 
going to keep happening...</b>

20:01.120 --> 20:02.100
<b>It will?</b>

20:02.400 --> 20:03.770
<b>Again?</b>

20:28.300 --> 20:29.950
<b>Kakeru-kun, is this...</b>

20:47.060 --> 20:47.860
<b>What—</b>

20:48.160 --> 20:50.490
<b>W-Was that a fragment of the future?</b>

20:53.490 --> 20:55.170
<b>Hey, what's wrong?</b>

21:02.530 --> 21:03.610
<b>No!</b>

21:04.020 --> 21:04.660
<b>Touko!</b>

21:05.100 --> 21:06.960
<b>What happened? What did you see?</b>

21:15.090 --> 21:16.440
<b>It can't be.</b>

21:17.320 --> 21:17.840
<b>Touko!</b>

21:47.780 --> 21:51.790
<b>From: Sacchan
Subject: Untitled</b>

21:47.780 --> 21:51.790
I'm home. Please come see me again. 
I have a book I want to lend you.

23:29.590 --> 23:30.840
<b>The place we promised...</b>

23:30.840 --> 23:32.060
<b>I want to go to that art room.</b>

23:32.060 --> 23:33.680
<b>I'm going to become a new me.</b>

23:33.680 --> 23:34.710
<b>Yeah, right.</b>

23:34.710 --> 23:35.910
<b>For tomorrow.</b>

23:35.910 --> 23:38.530
<b>And those were my lines.</b>

23:36.350 --> 23:38.850
<b>Episode 9
"Moon"</b>
